{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe infra cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `infra/bootstrap/main.tf:1-17` — Preserve bootstrap creates remote state bucket/locking prerequisites and ownership boundary. Consumer: Terraform operators.\n- `infra/github/apply-mirror-lock.sh:1-34,63-66` — Preserve exact lock effects, sole deploy-key bypass, precondition, optional legacy removal, recovery pointer. Consumer: GitHub operators.\n- `infra/github/rollback-mirror-lock.sh:1-21` — Preserve default safe behavior, destructive options, snapshot dependency, explicit feature restoration. Consumer: GitHub operators.\n- `infra/systemd/rebar-autodeploy.service:1-11,19-35` — Preserve timer cadence, storm guard distinction, environment overrides, correct health endpoint, fail-safe nonzero behavior. Consumer: systemd/operators.\n- `infra/terraform-github/main.tf:1-44,53-56,88-91` — Preserve main-only lock, deploy-key sole bypass, no repository resource, provider version fallback, required bypass-key precondition, imported ownership. Consumer: Terraform/GitHub operators.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by the row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] Every consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by the row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] No executable behavior changes; verified by inspecting the final diff and running the command under Verification.\n- [ ] No test assertion changes; verified by inspecting the final diff.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788586683394696001,"uuid":"3b5bbdfa-4e1a-441e-af17-3d02c90e49fa"}